  "description": "Every night, a man comes to Seyeon’s dreams, but who is he? Four years after losing five months of her memory, Seyeon is haunted by a faceless man who appears strong, tender, and intoxicatingly passionate. Who is this man who visits her every night? Is he her lost lover? The father of her child? Or just a stranger? How far will she go to uncover the truth?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
